{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, take it and perform task. Else, approach object. Always scan area if object isn't visible. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    />\"",
